metronomes," American Journal of Physics 70, 992 (2002).

Rehearsal note: time the centrepiece section against the real
simulator and the physical build specifically -- Pantaleone-style
metronome sync typically resolves in 1-3 minutes once coupling is
strong enough, but room noise, an unlevel surface, or too-gentle a
starting nudge can push that out. Run it a few times beforehand to
know your real number before trusting the 9:00-18:00 window.
:::
